@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1

###

### 1. List Categories (Paginated Resource)

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/categories?per_page=5&page=1
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Show Category (Resource)

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/categories/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Create Category

POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/categories
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Developer Productivity",
  "description": "Tools and workflows to improve developer productivity."
}

###

### 4. Update Category

PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/categories/1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "AI Tools & Productivity",
  "description": "Updated description for AI tools and productivity."
}

###

### 5. Delete Category (Replace ID with an unused category)

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/categories/8
Accept: application/json